                  "text": "The fading echo releases the clearing. A buried cable leads toward the shrine.",
                  "id": "forest.a.clearing.after.original-001",
                  "speakerId": "narrator",
                  "delivery": "Narration; observe rather than explain the emotion.",
                  "voiceId": "forest.a.clearing.after.original-001"
