                      "speaker": "Seismitoad, Floodgate Warden",
                      "speakerId": "seismitoad-floodgate-warden",
                      "text": "You wanted the floodgate opened. Feel what it was holding back.",
                      "delivery": "React to the confirmed battle event; do not interrupt play.",
